   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women&#x2019;s Rights Programme in Nepal, implemented by ActionAid and local partners aims to strengthen joint programme reflection, knowledge sharing and production of learning resources.  The main objective is to profile the work of the women&apos;s rights programme both internally and externally and connect programnme teams and partners to each other so there is cross learning and profiling in different international forums.   Objective: Joint programme reflection, knowledge sharing and production of learning resources. Outcome: Crosscutting outcome -  Learning from the programme is used to strengthen effectiveness and amplify women&#x2019;s voices</narrative>
  </description>
